{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":0,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"不知道咱们有没有了解？","semantic_type":"unknown","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":1,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"载体铜箔的设备我们已经研发出来了","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":2,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"但市场的增量没有想象的那么明显，大家都在炒这个概念。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"negated","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":3,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"您提到载体铜箔，应该也了解MSAP新工艺，窄线宽和窄线距的PCB版新工艺。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":4,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"这个工艺目前下游还有待验证效果。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":5,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"国内没有几个厂家能做，大头还在三井那边。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"negated","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":6,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"三井是这样。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":7,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"三井基本占据载体铜箔90%以上的份额。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":8,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"对，这个我们也比较了解。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":9,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"我们更关心的是DTH的表处理设备，它跟HVLP是完全通用的吗？","semantic_type":"unknown","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":10,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"还是不太一样？","semantic_type":"unknown","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":11,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"请您介绍一下。","semantic_type":"unknown","statement_role":"other","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":12,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"不能通用。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"negated","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":13,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"载体铜箔从名字就能听出来，完全不一样。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":14,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"首先要有载体才能往上长铜，载体铜箔是2到5微米，大部分需求是2微米的。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":15,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"3微米以上的电解铜箔已经能做出来，没必要用载体铜箔。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"negated","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":16,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"两微米的铜箔，首先要在载体上长，前提是载体怎么形成。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"condition","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":17,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"尽管后端跟表面处理机同步长铜的过程一样，","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":18,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"但前端必须有载体形成的过程。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":19,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"载体形成的第一步，很多厂家拿到的铜箔基层是18微米的标准铜箔，","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":20,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"所以生箔机是必须的。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":21,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"18微米的铜箔拿去处理，在表面处理机上开卷，然后在中间段跟表面处理机工序可能有重叠。","semantic_type":"forecast","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":22,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"先在18微米铜箔表面活化，再刷镀两层，两个槽子形成载体，然后后端同步长铜——在载体上长两微米的铜箔。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":23,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"后端还要做黑化、环氧化等，最后烘干收卷。","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
